{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_23"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"铸甲匠达尔曼","text":"[show]啊……唉？我……我刚刚好像昏掉了……你们在说什么？[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_3","text":"（告知达尔曼他刚刚干掉了大佬芙洛波。）"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"铸甲匠达尔曼","text":"[cm][show]那家伙……那家伙被干掉了？是我亲手……是我亲手解决掉的？！[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_5","text":"虽然最后你倒下了……"},{"tag":"tag_5","text":"应该是疲劳过度吧。"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"铸甲匠达尔曼","text":"[cm][show]噢噢噢！我真的做到了！我真的把那群家伙打败了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"铸甲匠达尔曼","text":"[show]我等会就把这个消息告诉大家！我——铸甲匠达尔曼，凭着我自己制作的武器——当然，经过了你们的强化——独自击败了那群袭扰通路的芙洛波！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"铸甲匠达尔曼","text":"[show]这下大家都要感激我了！我的护甲再也不会沾着臭味了！我从此以后就要翻身了！哈哈哈哈——！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":50,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":50,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]（原来如此，难怪你之前要瞒着他……原来是想让他重获信心啊……）[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_10","text":"但他的热情也是认真的，不是吗。"},{"tag":"tag_10","text":"信心可是生活最强大的动力呀。"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[cm][show]也对，对于经历太多失败的人来说，确实需要一场胜利振奋信心啦。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":50,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"铸甲匠达尔曼","text":"[show]非常感谢两位！没有你们帮忙强化的武器，我也不可能取得成功，这是给你们的报酬。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"铸甲匠达尔曼","text":"[show]呼呼呼，我等不及了～！我现在要去取得更大的胜利！我这就要去拿这把剑给瑟尔妲看看，让她知道我也是有锻兵天赋的，她要为她直接的垃圾话还债！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2p"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":50,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2p"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"x":0,"y":-10,"d":0.8,"layer":"chara1"},"key":"shake"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]啊！那——那个，可先别去——不不不，你刚刚大战了一番，现在还是先休息一下吧！[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_15","text":"没错！你才刚刚醒过来！"},{"tag":"tag_15","text":"还需要一段时间才能恢复状态！"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_16","text":"而且武器不是最重要的！"},{"tag":"tag_16","text":"最重要的是你自己的信心！"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":50,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2p"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"铸甲匠达尔曼","text":"[cm][show]唉？是、是吗……嗯……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"铸甲匠达尔曼","text":"[show]你说得对！武器只是外在之物，而且这把武器经过了你们的强化，不完全是我锻造的，炫耀也没什么意义。真正要证明自己的强大，还是得自己有本事才行。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"铸甲匠达尔曼","text":"[show]我要继续精进我的技术，然后有朝一日再找她提出锻造决斗！这样我就能彻底证明我自己的水平啦！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_19"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"铸甲匠达尔曼","text":"[show]我要继续加油！我要继续努力！谢谢你们——！[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_20"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_21","text":"加油！努力！"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_21"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":50,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[cm][show]对……继续加油……继续努力！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_22"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2k"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":50,"mirrow":false,"y":-190,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_c